## Recognition with a clear sense of identity

Custom military medals bring unit insignia, service symbols and commemorative details into a formal metal presentation. They suit service milestones, retirements, reunions, training achievements and memorial events where the emblem and inscription need to remain clear when worn or displayed.

## Preserve the hierarchy of the design

Plan the main crest, motto, date, border and suspension point together. Crisp 2D relief keeps lettering precise, while selected 3D details give eagles, shields, wreaths or portraits more depth. Polished highlights against sandblasted backgrounds, or an antique finish, help distinguish the different areas.

## From approved artwork to presentation

The chosen construction follows the design: die striking for defined raised and recessed layouts, or zinc-alloy casting for complex silhouettes, cutouts and deeper relief. Plating and optional enamel or printed details are followed by attachment assembly and inspection. Neck ribbons, short drape ribbons, pin-back fittings and presentation boxes can be coordinated for the ceremony.

## Plan your order

Available formats include 2-4 inches, with custom sizes possible. The minimum order is 50 pieces. Typical production takes 12-18 business days, excluding shipping. Share the insignia, wording, intended dimensions, quantity, delivery country and ceremony date. Confirm ribbon colors, attachment and packaging alongside the artwork so the finished award presents as one complete piece.
